595
00:30:02,490 --> 00:30:04,010
Some emergent
behaviors that they

596
00:30:04,010 --> 00:30:07,530
show are that the complexity
metrics increase over time

597
00:30:07,530 --> 00:30:10,210
so that can be expected if
the proposer is continuing

598
00:30:10,210 --> 00:30:13,770
to increase the difficulty
of what it's learning.

599
00:30:13,770 --> 00:30:16,090
And another aspect
is that the diversity

600
00:30:16,090 --> 00:30:18,610
of programs and answers, when
the loop is set up correctly,

601
00:30:18,610 --> 00:30:19,910
